Package: service-maestro-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Service Maestro <phedders@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: command-line client for Service Maestro
 Control live transport, inspect the live queue, manage set lists, call any
 Service Maestro HTTP API endpoint and run an interactive keyboard transport
 from a terminal. The client uses only the Python standard library.
